BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tom Yost - "The Colors of Nature" Opening Reception
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260921
DTSTAMP:20260904T144621Z
UID:ae09d87dac48d8f07f8d21e5d513@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Opening for Renowned Artist Tom Yost at The Good Gallery on Sa
 turday\, August 15th between 3 pm and 6 pm. On view through September 20 t
 h. The Good Gallery is pleased to present acclaimed modern realist Tom Yos
